{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231660","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231660","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423166001:0":{"text":"どうだ？ハガルド、これで村に残る気になった？","source_cn":"怎么样，铁须，现在你有信心继续待在村子了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7937DBA3E71DC11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423166002:1":{"text":"お前がここまでやったんなら……認めるしかない。俺の頭が固かったんだ。","source_cn":"既然你都做到这个份上了……我实在佩服。是我固执己见了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DFF41658FF89C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423166003:1":{"text":"村が混乱してる中で、逃げ道ばっか探してた。けど、お前たちは違った――現実を見て、何とかしようとしてたんだ。","source_cn":"这些日子里，面对村里的烂摊子，一直找借口推诿逃避的是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5213880C3EC345CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423166004:1":{"text":"あの成果を見せられたら、言うまでもないさ。みんな覚悟を決めて、ここに残るだろうよ。","source_cn":"看到这样的成果，不用我多说，村里的大伙也会主动留下，踏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9755E4FB0028F4D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423166005:1":{"text":"これまで悪かった……これからは、ゾーヤの頼みなら文句言わずにやるさ！","source_cn":"之前那些事，对不住啦！以后祖娅你让我出力，我绝对说一不二！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x529BED5AE58DDDC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423166006:1":{"text":"アンタにそんなこと言われたら、なんかくすぐったいんだけど！","source_cn":"铁须突然变得这么客气还真不有点不习惯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A19B4FE6AD28944","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423166007:1":{"text":"ともかく、みんな魔鋼のことで連日忙しく動き回ってたし、フーキンが帰ってきたのに歓迎会もしてないだろ！","source_cn":"好啦！为了魔钢的事，大家也忙了好多天了，连呼金回村都没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE3B281919412D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423166008:1":{"text":"この件も一段落ついたし……決めた！今日は休みだ！みんなで、フーキンの歓迎会でもしようじゃないか！","source_cn":"好在魔钢的事有些眉目了，我做主，今天给大伙放个假，一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9C338A00324274B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铁须":{"text":"ハガルド","source":"铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}